      "paragraph": "CoMo Peptides presents genuine supplier substance on product pages — CAS numbers, formulae, molecular weights, RUO lines and a refusal to give dosing — but sells through a consumer commercial posture and lets anyone browse. A5 shows a catalogue built around GLP-1, cosmetic and recovery compounds; A2 shows promotional order structure, quantity tiers, a free-shipping threshold and weekly units-sold counters; A6 shows no research qualification anywhere in sign-up; A1 sets those against the site's own research-only statements. [inference: the technical layer is real but sits on retail mechanics, so neither end of the spectrum fits.]",
